    "description": "Dialog Launches \u2018GanuDenu QR\u2019, Making Cashless Transfers Free for All with eZ Cash and Dialog Finance",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Dialog-Launches-GanuDenu-QR-Making-Cashless-Transfers-Free-for-All-with-eZ-Cash-and-Dialog-Finance/34-790578",
